sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Rv as Reviewer
    actor E as Engineer
    actor Rq as Requester
    participant RT as Routes
    participant A as AssignmentService
    participant W as WorkflowService
    participant DB as Database

    Rv->>RT: Start review, then Approve
    RT->>W: transition(cr, Under Review / Approved, reviewer)
    W->>W: Check role and that the move is allowed
    W->>DB: Update status + insert history

    Rv->>RT: Assign to engineer
    RT->>A: assign(cr, engineer, reviewer)
    A->>A: Check engineer is active and has Engineer role
    A->>DB: Set assignee + insert assignment history
    A->>W: transition(cr, Assigned)
    W->>DB: Update status + insert history

    E->>RT: Start work
    RT->>W: transition(cr, In Progress, engineer)
    W->>W: Check user is the assignee
    W->>DB: Update status + insert history

    E->>RT: Resolve with summary
    RT->>W: transition(cr, Resolved, engineer, summary)
    alt Summary is empty
        W-->>RT: Error: summary required
    else Summary given
        W->>DB: Save summary, update status + insert history
    end

    Rq->>RT: Close (or Reopen with reason)
    RT->>W: transition(cr, Closed or Reopened, requester, reason)
    W->>DB: Update status (+ closed date) + insert history
